## Summary

Declare Project

## Claim

### Prose Claim

A Project uses CAPRMEDIO's MODEL.

### Formal Claim

```CFEL
# model
Scope Unit/Project;

Project >| (Container == yes);

Project ((NARROWER_THAN)) Scope Unit;

# instances
Scope Unit/Project//$scope_unit{::1};

Project//$project {::0}((IS_CONTAINED_BY)) Scope Unit//$scope_unit_2;

Project//$project_2.order.ordered == false;

Project//$project_3.order.number:: []{::0}
```

## Semantics

A Project is the root Scope Unit. It is not renamed or moved through Scope Unit operations. The Project has one stable Scope Unit ID. The shared model makes Project unordered with no order.number; individual Project Declarations inherit these facts.
